UPDATE public.question
SET
    explanation = 'Option A (correct) AWS Migration Hub provides a central location to track the progress of application migrations from various AWS and partner migration tools, offering a consolidated view of your entire migration portfolio. Option B (incorrect) AWS Control Tower establishes and governs a secure, multi-account AWS environment with compliance policies, but it does not centralize the planning or tracking of specific migration project progress. Option C (incorrect) AWS Systems Manager automates operational tasks for AWS resources and on-premises servers, such as patching and inventory, but it is not designed to centralize or track overall migration project planning and progress across multiple projects. Option D (incorrect) AWS Service Catalog allows organizations to create and manage catalogs of approved IT services for deployment, but it does not facilitate the planning, tracking, or progress monitoring of migration projects.'
WHERE id = 'q_45_m_45_1_8';

